Wire pathhide.o into the proc filesystem build.
Copy pathhide.c to fs/proc/pathhide.c and pathhide.h to include/linux/pathhide.h,
then apply this hunk. Deliberately unconditional obj-y (no CONFIG_PATHHIDE), so
nothing lands in /proc/config.gz that could out the patch.

--- a/fs/proc/Makefile
+++ b/fs/proc/Makefile
@@ -6,2 +6,3 @@
 obj-y   += proc.o
+obj-y   += pathhide.o

